+## Windows section-backed RAM (experimental)
+
+The size-checked `RvgDeviceConfig.memory_sections` extension accepts one `RvgMemoryRangeSection` per range. Handles are borrowed for creation and duplicated by the device. Each offset is relative to its section. See [Windows host notes](windows.md).
